ws\",\n   104→        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n   105→      }\n   106→    ]\n   107→  },\n   108→  {\n   109→    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n   110→    \"title\": \"Cloud Agents Start 3x Faster with Builds\",\n   111→    \"description\": \"New Builds system provides pre-configured environments that agents boot into, delivering 10x faster environment boot and 3x faster time to first token. Agents use last successful build if environment breaks, with build history dashboard for inspection.\",\n   112→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   113→    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n   114→    \"date\": \"2026-08-13\",\n   115→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   116→  },\n   117→  {\n   118→    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n   119→    \"title\": \"Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash available in Copilot\",\n   120→    \"description\": \"New AI models Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash are now available in GitHub Copilot, providing developers with more model choices for AI-assisted coding.\",\n   121→    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n   122→    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/\",\n   123→    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n   124→    \"community_feedback\": [\n   125→      {\n   126→        \"quote\": \"It's a great model, It is definitely smarter, but it seems to use more tokens and turns complete slower. This makes it somewhat awkward to use.\",\n   127→        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n   128→        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n   129→      },\n   130→      {\n   131→        \"quote\": \"Gemini-3.7-flash is surprisingly pleasant to use. I prefer it. It's fast and much better at UI.\",\n   132→        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n   133→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n   134→      },\n   135→      {\n   136→        \"quote\": \"my favorite model is still grok-4.6. Best...\",\n   137→        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n   138→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n   139→      }\n   140→    ]\n   141→  },\n   142→  {\n   143→    \"productName\": \"GitHu