               JetBrains released a VS Code extension for their AI Assistant, empowered by a coding agent for complex tasks. Represents JetBrains' expansion beyond their own IDE ecosystem.\n   375→                    </div>\n   376→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   377→                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">JetBrains</span>\n   378→                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n   379→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-14</span>\n   380→                    </div>\n   381→                </div>\n   382→\n   383→                <div class=\"item\">\n   384→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   385→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ito-ai-code-review-that-runs-code\" target=\"_blank\">Ito</a>\n   386→                    </div>\n   387→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   388→                        AI code review tool that runs your application before reviewing code, using ephemeral environments to validate impacted flows and return runtime evidence for pull requests.\n   389→                    </div>\n   390→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   391→                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n   392→                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n   393→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-13</span>\n   394→                    </div>\n   395→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"#4 of the Week for August 13th, 2026\"</div>\n   396→                </div>\n   397→\n   398→                <div class=\"item\">\n   399→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   400→                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49185389\" target=\"_blank\">HyperProbe</a>\n   401→                    </div>\n   402→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   403→                        Tool that provides AI