    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-08-25</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .subtitle {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 3px;\n        }\n\n        nav {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 8px 15px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        nav a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            margin-right: 15px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n        }\n\n        nav a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .main-content {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 0;\n            min-height: 600px;\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            border-right: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 15px;\n        }\n\n        .column:last-child {\n            border-right: none;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .section-header .count {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 18px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n\n        .item:hover {\n            background-color: #fafafa;\n            margin: -15px -15px 3px -15px;\n            padding: 15px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #828282;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #828282;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .source-tag {\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\n            color: #856404;\n            border-color: #ffeeba;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #666666;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin: 6px 0;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .source {\n            font-size: 10px;\n            color: #ff6600;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .date-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 10px 15px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .main-content {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border-right: none;\n                border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            }\n\n            .column:last-child {\n                border-bottom: none;\n            }\n\n            .item:hover {\n                margin: 0;\n                border-radius: 0;\n                padding: 10px 12px;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .container {\n                border: none;\n            }\n\n            .main-content {\n                display: block;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: none;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .item:hover {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n                margin: 0;\n                padding: 10px 12px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">2026-08-25 | Daily Update on AI Coding Tools, Products, and Insights</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <nav>\n            <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a>\n            <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Product Updates</a>\n            <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Technical Insights</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <main class=\"main-content\">\n            <!-- New Products Column (40%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"new-products\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    New Products <span class=\"count\">(5)</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283105\" target=\"_blank\">Prized</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">YC S26 AI-powered internal tool building platform for non-engineers, letting anyone build and ship secure internal tools with AI assistance.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-21</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Giving every employee an AI coding assistant\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.mentlio.com\" target=\"_blank\">Mentlio</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">YC S26 engineering intelligence platform for the AI coding era, helping teams cut AI spend by up to 30% while providing engineering insights.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-20</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Helps teams cut AI spend by up to 30%\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283100\" target=\"_blank\">Zenbu</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">YC P26 terminal code tool - a VS Code-compatible CLI that runs inside your terminal over SSH, representing the code agent space.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-19</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC P26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283063\" target=\"_blank\">Bullet</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">YC S26 coding agent launched on Hacker News, founded by Adi and Alex, described as a faster coding agent that addresses slow performance of existing agents like Claude Code.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Faster coding agent addressing Claude Code slowness\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ito-ai-code-review-that-runs-code\" target=\"_blank\">Ito</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">AI code review tool that runs your application before reviewing code, using ephemeral environments to validate impacted flows and return runtime evidence for pull requests.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-13</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">#4 of the Week for August 13th, 2026</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Column (35%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Product Updates <span class=\"count\">(11)</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Feature</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code: Memory in Claude Cowork</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Memory now works across chat and Cowork in the cloud, with editable topics and a new sensitive topics setting that keeps items like health or beliefs out of memory unless enabled.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-25</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Release Notes →</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Memory enabled under Settings > Capabilities\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Aider: Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5, DeepSeek Reasoner</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Added support for Claude 4.5/4.6 models, expanded Gemini model support with 2.5 Flash/Lite and 3 preview, added DeepSeek Reasoner model, and improved exception handling.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-25</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">History →</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">Aider wrote 62% of the code in this release</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI 0.149.1: Agent Dashboard</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New release adds interactive agents dashboard, working directory commands, queue for sessions, and expanded Vim editing.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Announcement</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI: MCP Server Command Deprecated</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">The `codex mcp-server` command is now deprecated. Users should use the Codex app server instead, or the Codex plugin for Claude Code.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-08-21-the-new-github-copilot-experience-in-slack/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: Slack and Teams Integration</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">GitHub Copilot now brings shared agentic work to Slack and Microsoft Teams, allowing teams to collaborate with AI directly in their communication platforms.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-21</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-08-21-the-new-github-copilot-experience-in-slack/\" target=\"_blank\">Details →</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Try building with @github Copilot directly in Slack or Teams\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Feature</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cloud Agents and Harness Improvements</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Continued improvements to cloud agents and the Cursor harness system. Agents can now monitor PRs, watch Slack threads, and run scheduled tasks with subscriptions.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-19</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/origin-code-hosting\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Origin Code Hosting Platform</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Cursor launched Origin, a new code hosting platform and GitHub alternative. Features include repos, pull requests, issues, code review, and integrations with Vercel, Depot, and Buildkite.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-17</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog/origin-code-hosting\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More →</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Origin - Cursor's code hosting platform is now live!\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Feature</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Cloud Agents Start 3x Faster</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New Builds system provides pre-configured environments that agents boot into, delivering 10x faster environment boot and 3x faster time to first token.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-13</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Release</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New AI models Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash are now available in GitHub Copilot, providing developers with more model choices for AI-assisted coding.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-14</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Gemini-3.7-flash is surprisingly pleasant to use. I prefer it.\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Feature</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code: Security Scanning for Enterprise</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Enterprise plans received beta access to skill and plugin security scanning, which automatically checks third-party skills and plugins for malicious content.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-06</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\" target=\"_blank\">Release Notes →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"update-type\">Feature</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Google Workspace Plugins</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New integration with Google Workspace including Gmail for email management, Google Drive for file access and organization, and Google Calendar for scheduling.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-03</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Column (25%) -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    Technical Insights <span class=\"count\">(8)</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48861923\" target=\"_blank\">Why write code in 2026</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News discussion on the role of manual coding in 2026. Covers debates on whether developers should still write code manually or rely entirely on AI agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-25</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">softwaredoug | HN</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">human vs AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM limitations</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.21107\" target=\"_blank\">LLMs at Software Engineering and Security Intersection</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">August 24, 2026 arXiv paper presenting an evidence-centered structured survey and research agenda on LLMs in software engineering and security.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv Research</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM security</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">survey</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">research</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.20844\" target=\"_blank\">TRACE: Agentic Catalog Enrichment</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">August 24, 2026 arXiv paper on agentic systems for catalog enrichment using multi-source evidence grounding.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv Research</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">agentic systems</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">multi-source AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.20786\" target=\"_blank\">Multi-Agent Document Authoring</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">August 24, 2026 arXiv paper on multi-agent document authoring with asymmetric structural conditioning.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">ArXiv Research</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">multi-agent systems</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI collaboration</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46923543\" target=\"_blank\">Coding agents have replaced every framework I used</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News discussion on replacing frameworks with AI-generated code. Key insights on AWS SRE agents, 'vibe coding' concerns, and framework mental models.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-24</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">alainrk | HN</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">frameworks</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">maintainability</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49378768\" target=\"_blank\">Show HN: Huzzah – Novel Approach to AI Coding</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News discussion highlighting a novel approach to AI coding with selective assistance patterns.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-21</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">productivity</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49161518\" target=\"_blank\">LLMs Reward Expertise</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Hacker News discussion about CLI coding tools including Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode, Pi and their different capabilities.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-19</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">Hacker News</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">CLI tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Codex</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://blog.jetbrains.com/research/2026/08/ai-coding-agent-adoption-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">AI Coding Agents: Adoption Trends</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">JetBrains Developer Ecosystem Survey 2026 findings on AI coding agent adoption. Claude Code leads at 39% adoption, GitHub Copilot declined to 21%.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-08-18</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">JetBrains Blog</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">adoption statistics</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">survey</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <a href=\"#\">Report generated by Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by <a href=\"#\">Claude Agent SDK</a> | Generated: 2026-08-25 23:04:59 |\n            <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a> |\n            <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Updates</a> |\n            <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Insights</a>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
